{"overview":"شادروان به دردسرهای یک خانواده پس از فوت ناگهانی پدرشان می‌پردازد. خانواده آنها که در حاشیه شهر زندگی می‌کنند درآمدی جز فروش سبزی ندارند و حالا با درگذشت پدرشان ماجراهای تازه‌ای برایشان به وجود می‌آید.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Shadrvan deals with the troubles of a family after their father's sudden death. Their family, who live on the outskirts of the city, has no income other than selling vegetables, and now, with the death of their father, new adventures are coming to them.","tagline_en":"","runtime":94,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Hossein Namazi"],"crew_en":[],"countries":[],"cast":[{"name":"سینا مهراد","role":"Nader Maradona","photo":"/zOnKlmkVZ74wAolzK9FnLkAvkAy.jpg","en":"Sina Mehrad"},{"name":"Nazanin Bayati","role":"Pari","photo":"/kaSsippb7iOQqfWZzfMTjIfKOzM.jpg"},{"name":"گلاره عباسی","role":"Ahoo","photo":"/986IPhEddd4EZRUVWLnfEl22x1M.jpg","en":"Gelare Abbasi"},{"name":"Behrang Alavi","role":"Assad","photo":"/nYHCwsPFPpwCpnTnOdRJLSArh4U.jpg"},{"name":"Roya Teymourian","role":"Nazi","photo":"/eQXcd057ClTxzxXiMBLYWiF8KLD.jpg"},{"name":"رضا رویگری","role":"Hassan","photo":"/dAsuTd733w3kCY28Ry4JMU5APe8.jpg","en":"Reza Rouygari"},{"name":"Hamed Abbasi","role":"Jalal","photo":""},{"name":"Bahram Ebrahimi","role":"","photo":"/edh4DRlMOjxFZRf8V9JWvQXdnar.jpg"},{"name":"Maryam Afshar","role":"","photo":""},{"name":"Elaheh Afshari","role":"","photo":""},{"name":"Ahmad Aghaei","role":"Farid","photo":""},{"name":"Amir Hossein Alemi","role":"","photo":""}],"trailer":"a88oyfJ_COo","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/933203"}